"""Detect raising and changes of height, mostly from the current word.

'Raise', including raising money or a programming exception, has by far the
strongest negative response. Rising, lowering, lifting and highlighting are
weaker relatives. Split spellings and a few Chinese/Japanese equivalents are
recognized too. The response sometimes continues onto an article, possessive,
or 'of' following the raising word. Other words normally return zero.
