First, already, before/after, and their translations usually give a negative
response. The character 先 is especially strong, even in non-temporal uses;
compounds are weaker. Nearby grammar adjusts first/already. Other tokens are
silent, except for the small continuation in 'first of'. Only text is used.
"""
READS = ()

PRIOR_TIME = set('''prior priority priorit prioritize previously beforehand advance
    déjà bereits уже après trước بعد telah'''.split())
FIRST_TRANSLATIONS = set('''erste ersten première prima primera первый первой
    первого перв første eerste'''.split())
STRONG_FIRST = set('primero primeiro pierws önce zunächst'.split())
